l,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-31T23:10:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"569fecca-1ab8-4662-955a-e0c4d5a7e2d3","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511133483,"PostDateInt":1773201934000,"PostDate":"2026-03-11T12:05:34","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"智驾域控制器系统工程师/专家-【自动驾驶】(J21125)","OrgId":3874029,"Org":"R项目","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责控制器硬件系统设计与开发，负责自动驾驶域控制器的硬件方案评估、系统架构设计及关键性能指标（KPIs）定义；主导主控SOC（如英伟达Orin、地平线征程系列）、MCU及关键外围元器件（如内存、电源、接口芯片）的选型、分析与成本评估；\n2、与供应商完成硬件原理图、PCB Layout评审，确保设计满足车规级电磁兼容（EMC）、功能安全（ISO 26262）及可靠性（DV/PV测试）要求；\n3、负责硬件调试、测试验证，并与软件团队协作解决硬件与底层驱动相关的集成问题；\n4、负责域控制器基础软件架构设计，带头锁定并优化系统关键服务，如时间同步、通信（CAN/Ethernet）、诊断（UDS）、OTA升级的方案设计；\n5、 负责系统启动、稳定性、性能瓶颈的分析与调优，解决软硬件协同中的关键技术问题。编制硬件设计规范、底层软件接口文档、测试用例及技术方案等交付物；\n6、支持硬件测试、系统测试及整车集成测试，牵头分析与解决测试中发现的问题。","Require":"1、统招本科及以上学历，电子工程、电气工程、自动化、计算机科学、车辆工程或相关专业；\n2、3年以上汽车电子或嵌入式系统开发经验，具备自动驾驶域控制器、ADAS控制器或类似高性能计算平台的硬件开发或底层软件开发经验，有完整的车规级产品开发及量产经验者优先；\n3、硬件方向：深入理解汽车电子可靠性、EMC及功能安全设计；熟悉主流自动驾驶芯片平台特性。熟悉高速数字电路设计/Cadence等EDA工具为加分项；\n4、底层软件方向：熟悉车载通信协议（CAN, LIN, Ethernet, SOME/IP等），常用工具（CANoe, Wireshark）以及AutoSAR架构（经典或自适应）。熟悉C/C++编程/Linux内核或实时操作系统驱动开发为加分项；\n5、系统能力：具备良好的系统思维，能理解从硬件资源到软件栈的整体架构，并对自动驾驶关键技术（感知、决策、控制）有基本了解。\n6、具备出色的逻辑分析、问题解决和独立攻关能力，拥有优秀的团队协作与跨部门沟通能力，能承担项目领导职责。对技术有热情，具备创新精神，能持续关注并学习行业前沿技术。","ClassificationOne":"软件研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-11T12:05:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"65f99bde-bf3c-4b0a-9df2-17015fa3b468","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511133464,"PostDateInt":1773200839000,"PostDate":"2026-03-11T11:47:19","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"底软开发与集成工程师-【自动驾驶】(J19697)","OrgId":3874029,"Org":"R项目","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.自动驾驶域控制器底层软件，如相机服务、Lidar服务、BSP、以太网通讯、中间件等的开发与调试；\n2.自动驾驶应用层软件通讯协议接口制定、集成及相关工具开发；\n3.对自动驾驶域控制器上硬件资源例如CPU、GPU、内存、IO操作进行优化及系统健康度监控；\n4.底软诊断功能开发。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，专业方向包括计算机、软件、自动化、汽车、模式识别、机械、电子等理工科，工作经验不小于2年；\n2.拥有自动驾驶底层软件开发与部署经验，熟悉嵌入式Arm架构；具有C/C++开发经验；\n3.熟悉ROS2，熟悉DDS/SomeIP/ZMQ中的一种或几种，熟悉Nvidia域控为加分项：有通讯中间件的二次开发与部署经验；\n4.熟悉自动驾驶常见的软硬件架构，掌握摄像头、激光雷达等常见自驾传感器的原理及特点，掌握车载网关、自驾域控、网络通信等的基本原理；\n5.熟悉自动驾驶研发流程和技术特点，熟悉上下游相关方的特点，尤其是自动驾驶各软件模块的常用方法及优劣势，如感知、定位、规控、模型部署等，有过编程开发经验者更佳；\n6.了解功能安全或SOTIF开发流程，加分项：有L4或L3级自动驾驶产品的既往开发经验；\n7.踏实靠谱，积极肯干，具备良好的团队内及跨团队沟通能力。","ClassificationOne":"软件研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-11T11:47:19","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"1d4399d8-68e5-4f70-8f8d-13c7095dab29","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511125646,"PostDateInt":1770806818000,"PostDate":"2026-02-11T18:46:58","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件项目经理-A项目(J21054)","OrgId":3872919,"Org":"A项目","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId