、硬件、工艺、发布团队的协作边界。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，计算机、电子信息、自动化或相关专业。\n2、5 年以上软件测试经验，其中 3 年以上团队管理或测试体系建设经验，有从 0 到 1 或体系重构的实践。\n3、有软硬件结合产品（智能硬件、车机、嵌入式设备、自助终端、机器人等）的质量保障经验，能判断问题属于应用层、接口、底层依赖、设备还是环境。\n4、精通测试策略、风险驱动测试和回归策略，熟悉 Android 系统机制，能分析 logcat、崩溃日志和内存趋势。\n5、有质量度量和根因归因的实践经验，具备接口测试与自动化体系规划能力，能使用 Java 或 Python 编写脚本。\n决策果断、敢于承担结论责任，具备跨团队沟通推动能力和清晰的书面表达能力。","ClassificationOne":"软件研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-18T15:13:51","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6d74faa7-b493-42de-af23-b029c7cc0d4e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511230627,"PostDateInt":1794918891000,"PostDate":"2026-11-17T20:34:51","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"营运标准-小哈(J21838)","OrgId":700438899,"Org":"小哈快修学院","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责（Job Responsibilities）：\n1. 协助搭建完整营运标准手册体系，覆盖：选址评估、建店流程、SI 装修标准、门店人员配置、绩效方案、早晚班会流程、接待 / 服务 / 销售 SOP、安全管理、物料管理、巡检稽核标准等模块，输出 V1 及后续版本手册、图文指引、检查清单\n2. 下沉一线门店调研，收集督导、店长、加盟商反馈，结合用户体验差评、门店评价数据识别标准落地卡点，输出优化建议，支撑手册持续迭代\n3. 负责营运标准文档全生命周期管理：版本台账、内容校对、图文排版、归档同步，统一格式，保障文档可直接用于培训、门店自查、稽核检查、加盟商交付\n4. 配合标准落地：协助输出标准宣讲材料、落地说明，跟进门店试点落地，收集执行问题，形成问题台账。\n5. 联动培训、质检、用户体验团队，对齐标准要求，保障服务标准、邀评流程、销售动作和营运手册保持一致\n6. 完成负责人交办的标准化专项、门店样板标准梳理、加盟商标准包输出等工作","Require":"任职要求（Requirements）：\n1. 本科及以上，2 年及以上连锁门店运营、门店 SOP 体系搭建、营运手册撰写经验；两轮 / 汽车后市场、维保连锁优先\n2. 熟悉连锁门店全链路，懂新店筹建、店长管理、门店绩效、现场服务流程，能把口头流程转化成可落地、可检查的书面 SOP\n3. 文字功底扎实，擅长撰写流程手册、检查表、制度文件，逻辑强，严谨细致；熟练 PPT、Excel，会做图文 SOP\n4. 能接受必要门店出差，善于和店长、督导沟通，听得懂一线痛点，拒绝脱离门店的纸上标准","ClassificationOne":"线下运营","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-17T20:34:51","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"R